# Production images (D-101) need the workspace manifests, the packages and the services — not the mobile
# apps' code, local data, git history or build output. App manifests stay so the lockfile still matches.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-e2e
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
var
docs
assets
.env
.env.*
apps/customer/*
!apps/customer/package.json
apps/restaurant/*
!apps/restaurant/package.json
apps/rider/*
!apps/rider/package.json
apps/admin/e2e
